Umbrella Wallet (the "Software") is a free, independent, non-custodial wallet
client authored and published by the fear in this repository. It is provided to
the public at no charge as experimental, self-custody software for personal and
educational use — you run it on your own device, hold your own keys, and are in
sole control of your funds at all times. By downloading, installing or using the
Software you accept the terms below; if you do not accept them, do not use it.

